#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/recipes/integrations.md
msgid "`holoMolecule` declares atom selection outside render and calls useMolecule inside the binding. Bunshi owns model identity and resources; the Jotai store owns atom values. ScopeProvider selects the Bunshi scope, while Jotai's Provider defines a separate value-storage boundary."
msgstr "`holoMolecule` declares atom selection outside render and calls useMolecule inside the binding. Bunshi owns model identity and resources; the Jotai store owns atom values. ScopeProvider selects the Bunshi scope, while Jotai's Provider defines a separate value-storage boundary."

