msgid "If a molecule itself creates a store and observe effects, the application Provider must receive that exact store. Ordinary holo does not insert it automatically. Full example: [bunshi-effect.tsx](https://github.com/ggkguelensan/jotai-holo/blob/docs/reference-site/examples/bunshi-effect.tsx)."
msgstr "If a molecule itself creates a store and observe effects, the application Provider must receive that exact store. Ordinary holo does not insert it automatically. Full example: [bunshi-effect.tsx](https://github.com/ggkguelensan/jotai-holo/blob/docs/reference-site/examples/bunshi-effect.tsx)."

