#: docs/recipes/integrations.md
msgid "Why separate tools?"
msgstr "Why separate tools?"

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/recipes/integrations.md
msgid "[Bunshi molecules](https://github.com/saasquatch/bunshi) solve DI and lifetime, [jotai-effect](https://jotai.org/docs/extensions/effect) owns reactive resources, and holo binds Views. Keeping these roles separate preserves native tooling and avoids adding Bunshi to applications that do not need it. See the limits in [holoMolecule](/reference/holoMolecule) and [cage](/reference/cage)."
msgstr "[Bunshi molecules](https://github.com/saasquatch/bunshi) solve DI and lifetime, [jotai-effect](https://jotai.org/docs/extensions/effect) owns reactive resources, and holo binds Views. Keeping these roles separate preserves native tooling and avoids adding Bunshi to applications that do not need it. See the limits in [holoMolecule](/reference/holoMolecule) and [cage](/reference/cage)."

