#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/reference/createFormModel.md
msgid "- `options(initial)` returns native UseFormProps. It creates one createFormControl per model instance. `initial` is creation-only, never a reactive reset.\n"
"- `model({ form, initial })` optionally returns your atoms and actions. The returned instance includes those fields and `form`. The name form is reserved.\n"
