#: docs/reference/stateAtom.md
msgid "This is a narrower interface for state declarations, not a replacement for every atom overload. It makes the read-only intent of derived state clear. Use native atom whenever its extra flexibility is the point."
msgstr "This is a narrower interface for state declarations, not a replacement for every atom overload. It makes the read-only intent of derived state clear. Use native atom whenever its extra flexibility is the point."

